diff --git a/saas/README.md b/saas/README.md
index 28b0891..e0dc3f4 100644
--- a/saas/README.md
+++ b/saas/README.md
@@ -40,6 +40,20 @@ bin/dev # You need to start the dev server in the same terminal session
 
 This will ask for your 1password authorization to read and set the environment variables that Stripe needs.
 
+### Billing
+
+Plans live in `Plan` (`saas/app/models/plan.rb`): Free (1,000 cards, 1 GB), Unlimited ($20/month, 5 GB) and Unlimited+ ($25/month, 500 GB). Stripe hosts checkout and the customer portal; we only keep a copy of each account's subscription in `Account::Subscription`, kept current by webhooks.
+
+Each environment needs:
+
+* `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`
+* `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, the signing secret of a webhook endpoint pointing at `/stripe/webhooks` that sends the `customer.subscription.created`, `.updated`, `.deleted`, `.paused` and `.resumed` events
+* `STRIPE_MONTHLY_V1_PRICE_ID` (Unlimited) and `STRIPE_MONTHLY_EXTRA_STORAGE_V1_PRICE_ID` (Unlimited+)
+
+Configure the customer portal to allow switching between the two prices and cancelling.
+
+Support tools are at `/admin/accounts`: comp an account (it gets Unlimited for free), or override the card count and bytes used it's billed for.
+
 ### Stripe environments
 
 * [Development](https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1SdTFtRus34tgjsJ/test/dashboard)
